        {
          "type": "modopedia:text",
          "x": 2,
          "y": 16,
          "width": 96,
          "line_height": 9,
          "text": "The compass is not the recognizer itself; it is a precision drawing tool. It stores its radius in compass_radius and an optional pen in compass_pen."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• Shift+scroll changes radius; the client shows a radius overlay and syncs it to the server.\n• Hold right-click and turn your view to draw a circle or arc on the hit surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• The compass reduces broken boundaries, but it still needs ink with the mana effect."
    },
